# Debug screenshots from app/scc_llc_filer.py and app/ein_filer.py - these
# capture real customer data (legal name, address, phone, last-4 SSN) the
# moment a real filing runs, so they must never be committed. The scripts
# themselves now write to /tmp instead, but this stays as a backstop.
# Root-only (/*.png) so it doesn't also catch legitimate image assets
# nested under app/static or similar.
